    <string name="onboarding_1_title">Find the dua for the moment</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">Every dua from Seeking Serenity, sorted by what you\'re going through: grief, anxiety, illness, gratitude, rizq.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_title">Read it your way</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">Arabic, transliteration and translation, each on or off, at the size that\'s comfortable for you.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_title">A gentle nudge each day</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">Get a dua of the day and optional morning and evening reminders. Everything stays on your phone.</string>
    <string name="perm_rationale_title">Allow reminders?</string>
    <string name="perm_rationale_body">Sukoon only sends the reminders you turn on: the dua of the day and your morning and evening times. No marketing, ever.</string>
